<%- contentFor('headerBlock') %>

    <style>
        html, body {
            height: 100% !important;
            font-size: 20px !important;
        }
        a {
            color: #5d3424;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        body.error-page {
            background-image: url('/assets/img/404-error-bg.jpg');
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-size: cover;
			margin: 0;
        }

        .error-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            background-image: url('/assets/img/404-sincap.png');
            background-position: right bottom;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-size: 40% auto;
        }

        .error-items {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 400px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #5d3424;
            margin-left: 15vw;
        }

        .error-items img {
            max-width: 250px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        @media (max-width:767px) {
            .error-wrapper {
                background-image: none;
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .error-items {
                width: 100%;
                margin: 0;
            }

            p {
                padding-left: 30px;
                padding-right: 30px;
            }
        }
    </style>
<%- contentFor('body') %>
<body class="error-page">
    <div class="error-wrapper">
        <div class="error-items">
            <img src="/assets/img/404-logo.png">
            <p>Buralarda işe yarar pek birşey yok gibi. İsterseniz <a href="/">kelime.com</a> adresine tıklayarak anasayfaya gidebilir ya da sosyal medya hesaplarımız (<a href="https://www.facebook.com/kelimecom" target="_blank">facebook</a>, <a href="https://twitter.com/kelime_com" target="_blank">twitter</a> ve <a href="https://www.instagram.com/kelime_com/" target="_blank">instagram</a>) üzerinden gelişmeleri ve kampanyaları anlık olarak takip edebilirsiniz</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>